; İstif setup texts: English.
; Translators: copy this file as <language code>.isl (de, fr, es, it, pt, ru, ar, zh, ja, ko), translate only the
; text after "=", keep the key names. "%n" is a line break. Save the file as UTF-8 with BOM.
; setup\Istif.iss adds a language automatically when this file and Inno Setup's own message file both exist.

[CustomMessages]
; Name of the .istif file type in Windows Explorer
DosyaTuruAdi=İstif load plan
; Shown when the .NET 8 Desktop Runtime is missing; the setup stops
DotNetYok=This program needs the Microsoft .NET 8 Desktop Runtime (x64), which was not found on this computer.%n%nDownload and install ".NET Desktop Runtime 8" (x64) from Microsoft, then run this setup again:%nhttps://dotnet.microsoft.com/download/dotnet/8.0%n%nOpen the page in your browser now?
; Shown when the Microsoft Edge WebView2 Runtime is missing; the setup stops
WebView2Yok=This program needs the Microsoft Edge WebView2 Runtime, which was not found on this computer. It ships with Windows 11.%n%nDownload and install the "Evergreen Bootstrapper" or "Evergreen Standalone Installer" from Microsoft, then run this setup again:%nhttps://developer.microsoft.com/microsoft-edge/webview2/%n%nOpen the page in your browser now?
